; The test library (design section 14): a strict fake DOM for the diff tests,
; a host with a virtual clock, and the mocks of the libraries. It uses only the
; standard library, kilim and the pure libraries (kilim.router, kilim.http,
; kilim.websocket, kilim.storage), thus it builds also for js_of_ocaml and
; wasm_of_ocaml (test/cross).

(library
 (name kilim_testing)
 (public_name kilim.testing)
 (libraries kilim kilim.router kilim.http kilim.websocket kilim.storage)
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.coverage))
 (instrumentation
  (backend ppx_windtrap.mutate)))
